    "title": "High Wind Warning by NWS - NewsBreak",
    "text": "8 minutes ago Check NWS updates here\nEffective: 2025-12-10 21:17:00 PST Expires: 2025-12-11 04:00:00 PST Urgency: Expected Severity: Severe Certainty: Likely Instruction: Remain in the lower levels of your home during the windstorm, and avoid windows. Watch for falling debris and tree limbs. Use caution if you must drive. Target Area: Lower Garfield and Asotin Counties * WHAT...Southwest winds 30 to 40 mph with gusts up to 60 mph expected.\n* WHERE...Pomeroy and Alpowa Summit.\n* WHEN...Until 7 AM PST Thursday.\n* IMPACTS...Damaging winds will blow down trees and power lines. Widespread power outages are expected. Travel will be difficult, especially for high profile vehicles.",
